{"id":3031,"name":"Uchi Tama?! Uchi no Tama Shirimasen ka?","slug":"uchi_tama_uchi_no_tama_shirimasen_ka","synopsis":"Spin-off of \"Tama and Friends\" that reimagines the cast of the franchise as humans.\n\n“Tama & Friends: Have you seen my Tama?” debuted in 1983 as a popular character on stationery and accessories. Tama, the beloved neighborhood cat who is known for the patch on his forehead and yellow ears, has now taken on a human form! Featuring Tama and his quirky friends, Uchitama is a brand-new type of heartwarming anime that might even be the new definition of kawaii!?\n\nIn a city somewhere in Japan, there's a flyer often seen on Third Street with a picture of a cat with a kinked tail, bearing the words: “Have you seen Tama?” A young boy gazes at the flyer, but he has fluffy ears on his head…!? Watch the dogs and cats from Third Street take on a human form and get up to some mischief.\n\nTake a peek into the wonderful lives of Tama and his friends.\n\n(Source: Aniplex of America)","format":"TV","season":"WINTER","year":2020,"createdAt":"2021-03-27 00:44:45","updatedAt":"2021-03-28 09:05:29","resources":{"nodes":[{"site":"MAL","externalId":39942},{"site":"ANILIST","externalId":109964},{"site":"KITSU","externalId":42397},{"site":"ANIDB","externalId":14952},{"site":"ANN","externalId":22947},{"site":"ANIME_PLANET","externalId":13718},{"site":"OFFICIAL_SITE","externalId":null},{"site":"X","externalId":null},{"site":"CRUNCHYROLL","externalId":null}]},"images":{"nodes":[{"id":6047,"facet":"LARGE_COVER","path":"anime/large-cover/map86CEVDnZNPY4BFgGZgnqfj2BCXR8IDVkaarjn.png"},{"id":6048,"facet":"SMALL_COVER","path":"anime/small-cover/t0sFnnVaSe5E4GcKxplWi1tCMkTxGewXjwhlMVgY.avif"}]},"studios":{"nodes":[{"id":89,"name":"MAPPA","slug":"mappa"},{"id":172,"name":"Lapin Track","slug":"lapin_track"}]},"series":{"nodes":[]},"animethemes":[{"id":10076,"slug":"OP1","type":"OP","sequence":null,"song":{"id":10077,"title":"Friends","titleNative":null},"animethemeentries":[{"id"